# ------- Cell 8: Hodge dual and conformal Bregman form -------
# In [8]
# In Cl(1,1) (2D Minkowski), pseudoscalar I = gamma_0 gamma_1
# Reuse gamma matrices
g0 = Gamma[1]   # we use e1 for gamma0
g1 = Gamma[2]   # we use e2 for gamma1
